<title>ITALY: Venice air cargo traffic dips 11 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Venice air cargo traffic dips 11 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo traffic at Venice's Marco Polo airport fell by 8.6 percent in May to 1,076 tonnes against the same period of 1996, the airport's managing authority SAVE said.</p>
<p>			    May 97   Pct vs     Jan-May 97  Pct vs</p>
<p>					 May 96		     year ago</p>
<p> Cargo (Tonnes)	  1,076   down 11.1	5,759   up  1.5</p>
<p> Aircraft movements    3,579   up    6.3     16,417   up  5.0</p>
<p> Passengers	    268,313   up   10.8  1,094,634   up  8.2</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
